# CLAUDE.local.md (template)

Copy this file to `CLAUDE.local.md` (already gitignored — never commit the real one) and fill in
real values. `CLAUDE.md` refers to this file for actual connection details so they never end up
in the public repo.

## Proxmox host

- Address (Tailscale IP or LAN IP, whichever this machine can reach): `<fill in>`
- Web UI: `https://<host>:8006`
- SSH user: `<fill in>`

## VMs

VMID scheme: `9000s` = templates, `100s` = core infra, `200s` = workloads, `800s` = throwaway.

| VM | VMID | Address (Tailscale/LAN) | SSH user | Auth | Notes |
|----|------|--------------------------|----------|------|-------|
| core | 110 | | | | |
| monitoring | 120 | | | | |
| apps | 210 | | | | |
| media | 220 | | | | |
| accelerated | 230 | | | | |

## Local machine notes

- Tailscale must be up (`tailscale status`) for tailnet-only addresses to route.
- SSH key in use: `<path, e.g. ~/.ssh/id_ed25519>`
- Repo lives at `/opt/self-hosting` on each VM (see `DEPLOY.md`); `~/<stack>` symlink after first deploy.
